	"data": "Steam Frame Development Skill Tree\nVision\n\nMastery of Steam Frame development means: building standalone VR apps that run natively on Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 / SteamOS ARM64, understanding SteamOS/Holo Core internals deeply enough to modify the OS, navigating the full compatibility stack (Proton/FEX/Lepton), developing OpenXR applications and API layers for the Frame's unique hardware, streaming PC VR wirelessly, and building/certifying accessories that interface with the expansion port. You go from…",
